; Module definition of USBCOMV.VXD (98 DDK "Building a Virtual Device":
; the module name is the DDB name, the DDB is export ordinal 1). All code
; and data stay locked: port functions run at interrupt time.
; The module is USBCOMV, not USBCOM: NTKERN lists USBCOM.SYS with VXDLDR as
; USBCOM, and VCOMM's load of a VxD of the same name then got a
; Sys_Dynamic_Device_Reinit sent to the SYS's entry and a fatal exception 0E
; (98 SE guest leg, 2026-10-22).
VXD USBCOMV DYNAMIC
DESCRIPTION 'USBCOM CDC-ACM port driver'
SEGMENTS
    _LPTEXT CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    _LTEXT  CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    _LDATA  CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    _TEXT   CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    _DATA   CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    CONST   CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
    _BSS    CLASS 'LCODE' PRELOAD NONDISCARDABLE
EXPORTS
    _USBCOMV_DDB @1
